[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4415628800","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119344#issuecomment-4415628800","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119344","id":4415628800,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBzEmAA","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-10T15:18:15Z","updated_at":"2026-05-10T15:18:15Z","body":"Thanks for looking into this!\r\n\r\nThere’s no way that retrying for an arbitrary amount of time is the right fix, especially because the amount of time needed will be different between computers and configurations.\r\n\r\nMaybe we poll periodically and indefinitely until we are no longer receiving a `VK_INCOMPLETE`(?)\r\n\r\nCC @ArchercatNEO ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4415628800/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4415762058","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119344#issuecomment-4415762058","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119344","id":4415762058,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBzMuig","user":{"login":"Paperzlel","id":123300405,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1lqNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123300405?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel","html_url":"https://github.com/Paperzlel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-10T16:22:55Z","updated_at":"2026-05-10T16:22:55Z","body":"\r\n> There’s no way that retrying for an arbitrary amount of time is the right fix, especially because the amount of time needed will be different between computers and configurations.\r\n\r\nCorrect, I decided to go with the floppy disc count-of-three since it felt the most appropriate to me as a best-case scenario. In my testing, it never needed to run more than twice, so dropping it down to 2 runs as a double-check instead of an arbitrary number might be worth it.\r\n\r\n> Maybe we poll periodically and indefinitely until we are no longer receiving a `VK_INCOMPLETE`(?)\r\n\r\nThe issue with polling is that this could then waste a bunch of time on the CPU if the driver is taking its time to update. This function is called inside a swapchain resize event, and I personally would be really hesitant at adding anything potentially indefinite like that here. If that works better though in practice (since we don't throw an error if try number 3 doesn't pass) then I'm happy to do so.\r\n\r\nThanks for taking the time to review it!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4415762058/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4415928502","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119344#issuecomment-4415928502","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119344","id":4415928502,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBzW4tg","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-10T17:44:02Z","updated_at":"2026-05-10T17:44:02Z","body":"The polling I was suggesting would not be blocking, but instead something we do every frame until it succeeds. But that would add complexity as we would need to trigger a resize or something when it actually comes through…","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4415928502/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4416049582","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119344#issuecomment-4416049582","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119344","id":4416049582,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBzeRrg","user":{"login":"Paperzlel","id":123300405,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1lqNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123300405?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel","html_url":"https://github.com/Paperzlel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-10T18:43:08Z","updated_at":"2026-05-10T18:43:08Z","body":"> The polling I was suggesting would not be blocking, but instead something we do every frame until it succeeds. But that would add complexity as we would need to trigger a resize or something when it actually comes through…\r\n\r\nI don't think the polling every frame would be a good idea, because the event is most easily triggered on resizes (and only occasionally at that). If we did so, then we'd have to wait for another frame to pass whilst skipping the entire swapchain resize, causing the screen to noticeably lag before updating. And as you said, it's quite complex and I'm not certain such a change would be worth it for the relatively simple fix that a relatively small number of people experience.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4416049582/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4433548469","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119344#issuecomment-4433548469","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119344","id":4433548469,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCEKUtQ","user":{"login":"Paperzlel","id":123300405,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1lqNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123300405?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel","html_url":"https://github.com/Paperzlel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-12T18:28:56Z","updated_at":"2026-05-12T18:28:56Z","body":"Okay, I changed the code to be a `while` loop instead of a `for` loop. It'll now run until the full list is obtained instead of running an arbitrary number of times, which should hopefully prevent any problems for slower computers. It might induce small lag spikes on window resizes if that's the case, but I doubt that will happen.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4433548469/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4453380088","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119344#issuecomment-4453380088","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119344","id":4453380088,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCXEv-A","user":{"login":"Paperzlel","id":123300405,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1lqNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123300405?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel","html_url":"https://github.com/Paperzlel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-14T18:05:09Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T18:05:09Z","body":"> Looks good, though shouldn't `swap_chain_get_hdr_output_supported` also be updated?\r\n\r\nI wasn't aware it used the same code, fixed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4453380088/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4479558984","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119344#issuecomment-4479558984","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119344","id":4479558984,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCwClSA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-18T16:10:08Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T16:10:08Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4479558984/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_a